[goal]
Find out why /checkout p95 latency jumped from 200ms to 1.4s after the
Tuesday deploy.

[context]
The regression started with the deploy that added src/checkout/tax.py. Traces
show most time is spent in compute_tax(). The cart service in
src/checkout/cart.py calls it once per line item with no caching.

[constraints]
- Read-only investigation, no fixes in this session
- Capture findings for the next agent

[handoff]
- to=any do=confirm compute_tax() is the hotspot with a profiler
- to=any do=document whether per-item calls can be batched
